#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build your first quantum circuit in under two minutes, on your local environment - no sign-in or API key necessary.\n"
msgstr "Erstelle deinen ersten Quantum Circuit in unter zwei Minuten, in deiner lokalen Umgebung – ohne Anmeldung oder API-Schlüssel.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"New to Python and virtual environments?\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Neu bei Python und virtuellen Umgebungen?\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download Python and use a virtual environment with Qiskit (recommended).\n"
msgstr "Lade Python herunter und nutze eine virtuelle Umgebung mit Qiskit (empfohlen).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Click to expand for more information about **Python**.\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Zum Erweitern klicken für weitere Informationen zu **Python**.\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To install Python, first check the \"Programming Language\" section on the [Qiskit PyPI project page](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/) to determine which Python versions are supported by the most recent release. For download instructions, see the [Python Beginners Guide](https://wiki.python.org/moin/BeginnersGuide/Download).\n"
msgstr "Um Python zu installieren, überprüfe zuerst den Abschnitt „Programming Language\" auf der [Qiskit PyPI-Projektseite](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/), um festzustellen, welche Python-Versionen von der aktuellen Version unterstützt werden. Installationsanweisungen findest du im [Python Beginners Guide](https://wiki.python.org/moin/BeginnersGuide/Download).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"These instructions use the standard Python distribution from [pypi.org](https://pypi.org/). However, you can use other Python distributions, such as [Anaconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/anaconda/) or [miniconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/miniconda/), along with other dependency management workflows like [Poetry](https://python-poetry.org/docs/).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Diese Anleitung verwendet die Standard-Python-Distribution von [pypi.org](https://pypi.org/). Du kannst jedoch auch andere Python-Distributionen verwenden, wie [Anaconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/anaconda/) oder [miniconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/miniconda/), zusammen mit anderen Abhängigkeitsverwaltungs-Workflows wie [Poetry](https://python-poetry.org/docs/).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"Click to expand for more information on **virtual environments**.\">\n"
"    - Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html) to separate Qiskit from other applications.\n"
"    A Python virtual environment is an isolated space to work with Python for a specific purpose — so you can install whatever packages you wish, and set up libraries, dependencies, and so on, without affecting the \"base\" Python environment on your machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"Zum Erweitern klicken für weitere Informationen zu **virtuellen Umgebungen**.\">\n"
"    - Verwende [virtuelle Python-Umgebungen](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html), um Qiskit von anderen Anwendungen zu trennen.\n"
"    Eine virtuelle Python-Umgebung ist ein isolierter Bereich, in dem du Python für einen bestimmten Zweck nutzen kannst – du kannst beliebige Pakete installieren sowie Bibliotheken und Abhängigkeiten einrichten, ohne die „Basis\"-Python-Umgebung auf deinem Rechner zu beeinflussen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    One important advantage of a virtual environment is that if your Python environment becomes corrupted, you can easily delete it and start over!\n"
msgstr "    Ein wichtiger Vorteil einer virtuellen Umgebung ist, dass du sie einfach löschen und neu beginnen kannst, falls deine Python-Umgebung beschädigt wird!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Choose a preferred location in which to store information about your virtual environments. Typically they're stored in a directory named `.venv` within each project directory.\n"
msgstr "    Wähle einen bevorzugten Speicherort für Informationen zu deinen virtuellen Umgebungen. In der Regel werden sie in einem Verzeichnis namens `.venv` innerhalb jedes Projektverzeichnisses gespeichert.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    To set up a virtual environment, navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr "    Um eine virtuelle Umgebung einzurichten, navigiere in dein Projektverzeichnis und erstelle eine minimale Umgebung, in der nur Python installiert ist.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Next, activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "    Aktiviere anschließend deine neue Umgebung.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
"              If using PowerShell:\n"
msgstr ""
"           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
"              Bei Verwendung von PowerShell:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"             If using Git Bash:\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"             Bei Verwendung von Git Bash:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             source .venv/scripts/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"              If using command prompt:\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             source .venv/scripts/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"              Bei Verwendung der Eingabeaufforderung:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"      </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"      </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"

